WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.500
This is all true today.

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:10.100
Competitors change prices without telling anybody.

3
00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:14.300
Two clicks to watch it. Nothing to configure.

4
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:20.300
An email when something you care about moves.

5
00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:27.000
Not a digest. One change, one email, the thing that changed in the subject line.

6
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Off by default, except for prices.

7
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:37.400
A tool that mails you every day gets filtered, and then it is worth nothing.

8
00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:43.400
It shows both versions, both dated.

9
00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:49.400
You can see that it happened rather than take our word for it.

10
00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:53.400
What it costs is next.
